\begin_inset Formula
$\tilde{C}$
\end_inset
, וכמו כן נסמן:
\begin_inset Formula
\[
S:=\max\left\{ 1,\sum_{i=1}^{k}\begin{pmatrix}k\\
\left\lceil \frac{k}{2}\right\rceil 
\end{pmatrix}\cdot d^{i}\right\} 
\]


