\begin_inset Formula
$\left(r,\theta,\phi\right)\mapsto\left(r\cdot\sin\theta\cdot\cos\phi,r\cdot\sin\theta\cdot\sin\phi,r\cdot\cos\theta\right)$
\end_inset

